suppress.notes:
tomcat-embed-core 10.1.41: HTTP/2, AJP, mTLS CVEs. TLS at ingress;
      not internet-exposed; HTTP/2 off; AJP not configured; no mTLS.
      BOM-managed; no upgrade without Spring Boot upgrade.

quartz 2.5.0: CVE-2023-39017 SQL injection in JobStoreSupport.
      Spring Boot wraps with LocalDataSourceJobStore (prepared statements);
      all job parameters are internal server-side data.
